    }
  ],
  "confidence": "low",
  "decision_summary": "Predicted pass: the closest evidence molecule (MeNTI) shows direct human brain PET uptake, and nor-BNI confirms brain exposure after systemic dosing in mice; contradictory rat data come from peripherally restricted opioid analogs and are outweighed by the direct CNS-penetrant evidence.",
