    "Low Morgan similarity scores (0.24-0.34) limit transferability to the query.",
    "No direct in vivo CNS data for the query itself are provided.",
    "Contradictory evidence is dominated by molecules with known peripheral-restriction features such as PEGylation, quaternary amines, or guanidine groups."
  ],
